[5] = "A distancia (Wowhead)",
-- 5c5cdd9b English: Every ranged Hunter from level 1 to 60 (Beast Mastery, Marksmanship, and
--     Survival until Strider Kick), and the Forever Hunter default. Pull: Hunter's Mark, Sniper
--     Shot while Rapid Killing lasts, Auto Shot. Then your own Serpent Sting, Summon Hawk twice and
--     Arcane Shot once on their shared cooldown (Arcane Shot on cooldown before Summon Hawk),
